   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regal Forest Costa Rica</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed financing consists of several independent medium term loans, to be granted directly to some operations of Regal Forest Holdings Co. Ltd., located in Trinidad y Tobago, Costa Rica, Paraguay, Guyana y Barbados. These independent loans will have as an objective to finance the client loan portfolio of each of these operations, specifically for the C&amp;D socioeconomic segment. The proposed financing for each Borrower, will be in local currency.</narrative>
  </description>
